      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-32-2023-june/q1",
      "question": "<p>A car is initially at rest on a straight horizontal road.</p><p>The car then accelerates along the road with a constant acceleration of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3.2\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-2}}\"></span></p><p>Find</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>the speed of the car after <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5\\,\\mathrm s\"></span>, <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li><li>the distance travelled by the car in the first <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5\\,\\mathrm s\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
