    {
      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-32-2023-june/q2",
      "question": "<figure class=\"practice-figure\" style=\"max-width:120mm;margin:2mm auto\"><img src=\"resources/exams/edexcel-9ma0-32-2023-june/q02-figure.svg\" alt=\"Figure 1. A particle P (5 kg) on a horizontal line, pulled to the right by a horizontal force of 28 N, with a frictional force F N acting to the left.\"></figure><p>A particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> has mass <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5\\,\\mathrm{kg}\"></span>.</p><p>The particle is pulled along a rough horizontal plane by a horizontal force of magnitude <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"28\\,\\mathrm N\"></span>.</p><p>The only resistance to motion is a frictional force of magnitude <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"F\"></span> newtons, as shown in Figure 1.</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find the magnitude of the normal reaction of the plane on <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li></ol><p>The particle is accelerating along the plane at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1.4\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-2}}\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"F\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol><p>The coefficient of friction between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> and the plane is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mu\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"3\"><li>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mu\"></span>, giving your answer to 2 significant figures. <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li></ol>",
