      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-32-2023-june/q3",
      "question": "<p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> seconds, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\\geqslant0\"></span>, a particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> has velocity <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}\"></span> where</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v=\\left(t^2-3t+7\\right)\\mathbf i+\\left(2t^2-3\\right)\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>Find</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>the speed of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> at time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=0\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is moving parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\mathbf i+\\mathbf j)\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li>the acceleration of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> at time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> seconds <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li><li>the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> when the direction of the acceleration of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is perpendicular to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
