      "id": "exam/edexcel-9ma0-32-2023-june/q4",
      "question": "<p>[In this question, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf j\"></span> are horizontal unit vectors and position vectors are given relative to a fixed origin <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span>]</p><p>A particle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> is moving on a smooth horizontal plane.</p><p>The particle has constant acceleration <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2.4\\mathbf i+\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-2}}\"></span></p><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=0\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> passes through the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span>.</p><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=5\\,\\mathrm s\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> passes through the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\"></span>.</p><p>The velocity of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> as it passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span> is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-16\\mathbf i-3\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm{m\\,s^{-1}}\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\"><li>Find the speed of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> as it passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol><p>The position vector of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span> is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(44\\mathbf i-10\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm m\"></span>.</p><p>At time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=T\"></span> seconds, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T&gt;5\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P\"></span> passes through the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span>.</p><p>The position vector of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4\\mathbf i+c\\mathbf j)\\,\\mathrm m\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\"></span>. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol>",
